summary: 'Implemented the two field-test-blocking instrument fixes from the readiness audit. B-1: the native path dropped byte-only work (assets/fonts/.js/.env/docs) because proposeNative returned {noop:true} on any empty meaning delta and admitNative NOOP''d it — now it seals a byte-custody strand when the tree advanced and carries it forward as a FAST_ADMIT, mirroring the git-era pick path. B-3: the CLEAN→byte-conflict KNOT downgrade returned without persisting a payload, so health''s contested denominator (listKnotPayloads().length) counted it as zero while the shadow arm counted it — now both contested sites persist through one shared helper and a payload-build failure surfaces as payloadError instead of being swallowed. Typecheck clean; new byte-custody-native.test.ts green; existing native tests green.'
